  "label": "Sharia Law",
  "description": "Sharia law is a system of religious law derived from the Quran and Hadith, which governs various aspects of life, including moral conduct, family law, and criminal law. The prohibition of alcohol in many Islamic countries is based on Sharia law, which considers alcohol an impure substance. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of Sharia law and its role in Islamic societies.",
